  "description": "A figure of speech that uses imagery to represent an abstract idea. In this meme, the act of erasing the word 'Abortion' with chalk is a visual metaphor for the removal or invalidation of abortion as a choice or right. Understanding this requires knowledge of how visual symbols are used to convey abstract political or social messages.",
